{"hw":"δημηγορία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δημηγορία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δημηγορ-ία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">deliberative speaking,</b> opp. forensic (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">δικανική</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1354b28</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speech in the public assembly,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.243</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Jul.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.75b</span> </span>(pl.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">position of a public speaker,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36b</span> </span>(pl.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> esp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">popular oratory, claptrap,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">162d</span> </span>.</div></div>"}